Cell["\<\
Using a Gr\[ODoubleDot]bner basis, we derive the conditions for the surface \
in terms of the phase space parameters.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962244826115238*^9, 3.9622448661171*^9}, {
  3.962244910663312*^9, 3.9622449757414923`*^9}, {3.962245017164402*^9, 
